WEBVTT

00:09:26.931 --> 00:09:30.913
That is the reveal Stevens
saves for that fourth stanza,

00:09:30.913 --> 00:09:33.691
where run away has become a refrain.

00:09:33.691 --> 00:09:35.883
This person might want to run away too,

00:09:35.883 --> 00:09:38.173
but fortified by the sun's example,

00:09:38.173 --> 00:09:40.898
he might just rise.

00:09:40.898 --> 00:09:45.176
Stevens saves that sonically odd word "meditation"

00:09:45.176 --> 00:09:46.850
for the end.

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:49.751
Unlike the sun, human beings think.

00:09:49.751 --> 00:09:53.848
We meditate on past and future, life and death,

00:09:53.848 --> 00:09:56.394
above and below.

00:09:56.394 --> 00:10:00.178
And it can make us afraid.